Subject: [PATCH 2/3] [Bugfix] Enable DSpark for DeepSeek V4 Vision

Expose the Vision wrapper through the EAGLE3 target interface, allow the Vision draft-config transform only for DSpark, and use the checkpoint dspark_block_size rather than its MTP depth as the trained draft width.

Co-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
Signed-off-by: Luca Motz <luca.motz@icloud.com>
